Z||000001||fiero56||09-26-2000||09:18 PM||||I have it on paper somewhere around here, but I guess I will let the cat out of the bag(at least to those that don't know yet). I have spoken with several people, and it happens that the Ford Mustang had "factory" C&C t-tops. This is the same company that GM used for "factory" t-tops on the fiero. Dimensions, fit, sizing, etc, are supposed to be exact to that of the Fiero. Also cost much less from the Ford dealer than from from anyone selling p-seals with the word "Fiero" in the ad.<P>I don't have the paper in front of me that tells exact model year Mustangs, that used Fiero p-seals. Also, has been about a year sinec I last heard about this, so don't know if it is exactly true, but the person swore it was(reputable Fiero parts dealer, can't remember who).||||reg||1
